{"t":"CRDO","made":"2026-11-17 08:51","name":"Credo Technology Group Holding Ltd","ko":"크레도","sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductors","employees":807,"hq":"Grand Cayman, Cayman Islands","website":"https://credosemi.com","summary_en":"Credo Technology Group Holding Ltd provides various high-speed connectivity solutions for optical and electrical Ethernet and PCIe applications in the United States, Taiwan, Mainland China, Hong Kong, and other international markets. The company offers ZeroFlap (ZF) active electrical cables and ZF optical transceivers, OmniConnect memory solutions, and a suite of retimers and DSPs for optical and copper Ethernet and PCIe, as well as integrated circuits, active electrical cables, and SerDes chiplets. It also provides intellectual property (IP) solutions, including SerDes IP licensing. The company offers was founded in 2008 and is headquartered in Grand Cayman, the Cayman Islands.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Credo Technology Group Holding Ltd는 미국, 대만, 중국 본토, 홍콩 및 기타 국제 시장에서 광, 전기 이더넷 및 PCIe 애플리케이션을 위한 다양한 고속 연결 솔루션을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 ZeroFlap(ZF) 능동 전기 케이블 및 ZF 광 트랜시버, OmniConnect 메모리 솔루션, 광 및 구리 이더넷과 PCIe를 위한 리타이머 및 DSP 제품군은 물론 집적 회로, 능동 전기 케이블 및 SerDes 칩렛도 제공합니다. 또한 SerDes IP 라이센스를 포함한 지적 재산(IP) 솔루션도 제공합니다. 이 회사는 2008년에 설립되었으며 케이먼 제도의 그랜드 케이먼에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":120.71,"mcap":22687676416.0,"pe":42.804966,"fpe":12.428788,"peg":null,"ps":14.259607,"pb":8.307068,"ev_ebitda":44.141,"div":0.0,"beta":3.292,"hi52":308.67,"lo52":86.485},"fin":{"rev":1591044992.0,"rev_g":1.147,"eps_g":0.971,"gross":0.67067003,"op":0.31738,"net":0.33833,"roe":0.30674,"fcf":248290880.0,"cash":764257984.0,"debt":26205000.0,"de":0.96,"eps":2.82,"feps":9.71213},"own":{"short":0.0587,"inst":0.77193,"insider":0.101689994},"analyst":{"n":19,"mean":277.46643,"median":285.0,"high":315.0,"low":175.0,"rec":"none","recMean":null,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":5,"buy":14,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongB